---
config:
  xyChart:
    width: 600
    height: 400
    titleFontSize: 26
    titlePadding: 20
    showDataLabel: true
    showDataLabelOutsideBar: true
    showLegend: true
    legendFontSize: 12
    legendPadding: 16
    chartOrientation: horizontal
    plotReservedSpacePercent: 60
    useMaxWidth: false
    xAxis:
      labelFontSize: 12
      labelPadding: 8
      titleFontSize: 18
      titlePadding: 8
      tickLength: 8
      tickWidth: 3
      axisLineWidth: 3
    yAxis:
      showTick: false
      labelRotation: 30
description: >-
  every top-level xyChart key and the axis keys from front matter: a 600 × 400 fixed-size
  canvas (useMaxWidth false, D387), horizontal, data labels outside the bars, a larger title,
  a smaller legend, thicker x axis parts, no y ticks (labelRotation reads the bottom axis only)
---
